# CR 702.37a, 702.37e, 118.3, 701.9a. Putrid Raptor is cast face down for exactly {3} (Black Lotus's three mana, the pool empty right
# after): a nameless 2/2. "Morph-Discard a Zombie card": with only Islands in hand the turn-up is refused; on turn 3 Bot1 draws
# a Zombie (Walking Corpse) and may turn it up, discarding the Corpse (an Island in hand is not a Zombie card and stays). It is then
# the card, a 4/4 with morph, and cannot be turned up again without another Zombie card.

